# expect.stdout: ipt\n
# expect.exit: 0
project PointerReturningRecursion
target console
runtime AgentRuntime 0.1
entry console main
error MainError
errorCase MainError Placeholder Int32

operation advanceBy
input operation advanceBy buffer String
input operation advanceBy steps Int64
output operation advanceBy Result String Void
memory advanceBy heap no
async advanceBy no
purpose operation advanceBy "Recursively return a pointer offset `steps` bytes past `buffer`. Exercises a recursive user op that returns a pointer (String)."
invariant operation advanceBy "Each level peels off one step; base case (steps == 0) returns the buffer unchanged."
label startAdvanceBy
storage module immutable zeroSteps Int64 0
storage module immutable oneStep Int64 1
call doneCheckCall math.equalInt64
argument doneCheckCall left Int64 steps
argument doneCheckCall right Int64 zeroSteps
run doneCheckCall
bind value isDone Bool doneCheckCall
branch if condition isDone target abReturnAsIs
call shiftCall pointer.offset
argument shiftCall base String buffer
argument shiftCall offset Int64 oneStep
run shiftCall
bind value shiftedBuffer OpaquePointer shiftCall
call decStepsCall math.subtractInt64
argument decStepsCall left Int64 steps
argument decStepsCall right Int64 oneStep
run decStepsCall
bind value nextSteps Int64 decStepsCall
call recurseCall advanceBy
argument recurseCall buffer String shiftedBuffer
argument recurseCall steps Int64 nextSteps
run recurseCall
bind ok recursiveResult String recurseCall
return ok recursiveResult
label abReturnAsIs
return ok buffer

operation main
input operation main console Console
output operation main Result ExitCode MainError
effect main read memory.buffer
effect main write console.stdout
memory main heap no
async main no
purpose operation main "advanceBy('semanticscript', 11) should return a pointer to 'ipt' (offset 11 is 'i'). Then writeLine prints 'ipt'."
invariant operation main "Verifies pointer-returning recursive user op + bind of its result + console.writeLine over a bind pointer."
label startMain
storage module immutable phrase String "semanticscript"
storage module immutable skipCount Int64 11
call advanceCall advanceBy
argument advanceCall buffer String phrase
argument advanceCall steps Int64 skipCount
run advanceCall
bind ok shiftedPointer String advanceCall
call writeCall console.writeLine
argument writeCall console Console console
argument writeCall text String shiftedPointer
run writeCall
ignore void source writeCall
storage module immutable successfulExitCode ExitCode 0
return ok successfulExitCode
